---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Products — Syntegreti" description="Explore Syntegreti's AI products: BetterSDLC, Workweave, and Datacenter Solutions.">
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-20"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-accent/5 blur-[120px]"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16" data-animate>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">// our_products</span>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Three products.<br />
          <span class="gradient-text">All ours. All shipping.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Most companies our size pick one lane. We built the whole highway —
          from developer tools to AI agents to datacenter intelligence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6" data-stagger>

        <!-- BetterSDLC -->
        <a href="/products/bettersdlc" class="group glow-card-subtle block p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
                <span class="text-3xl">⚡</span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Product</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent sm:text-3xl">BetterSDLC</h2>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-text-muted">Ship better software, faster</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
                Enterprise AI coding workflow optimization that replaces ad-hoc prompting
                with structured SDLC questionnaires. Every role — from Business Analyst to
                Tester — gets guided AI interactions that produce consistent, auditable,
                high-quality code. For a 50-developer team: 40% less rework, 60% faster
                AI onboarding, and $780k+ in annual developer time saved.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-accent">
                Explore BetterSDLC
                <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              {[
                { label: 'SDLC Workflows', desc: '5 role-based phases: BA → Architect → Sr Dev → Dev → Tester' },
                { label: 'Context Threading', desc: 'Info auto-flows between phases — zero manual handoff' },
                { label: 'Org Learning', desc: 'Prompts improve based on team outcomes via DSPy' },
                { label: 'Compliance Audit', desc: 'Full traceability: code → prompt → requirement' },
                { label: 'VS Code + Desktop', desc: 'Extension, Electron app, CLI, and MCP server' },
                { label: 'AI-Agnostic', desc: 'OpenAI, Claude, local models — your choice' },
              ].map((f) => (
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-deep/50 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <div class="text-xs font-medium text-text-primary">{f.label}</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">{f.desc}</div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Workweave -->
        <a href="/products/workweave" class="group glow-card-subtle block p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
                <span class="text-3xl">🔮</span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-cyan/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan">Product</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan sm:text-3xl">Workweave</h2>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-text-muted">Agentic OS for Business</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
                An intelligent operating system that orchestrates specialized AI agents
                across your enterprise systems. Built on the VoltAgent framework, each agent
                understands your business context, queries Salesforce, ServiceNow, and Snowflake
                in parallel, and delivers synthesized intelligence in 30 seconds — not 15 minutes.
                97% faster context gathering. 40-60% ticket reduction. $72K annual savings per 1,000 users.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-cyan">
                Explore Workweave
                <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              {[
                { label: 'Multi-Agent Orchestration', desc: 'Specialized agents coordinated by a supervisor' },
                { label: 'VoltAgent Framework', desc: 'TypeScript-native, production-grade agent infra' },
                { label: 'Enterprise RAG', desc: 'Semantic search across docs, KB, and unstructured data' },
                { label: 'Voice + Chat', desc: 'VAPI voice, web chat, extendable to Slack/Teams' },
                { label: 'Smart Escalation', desc: 'Human-in-the-loop with full context handoff' },
                { label: 'Cross-System Intel', desc: 'Salesforce, ServiceNow, Snowflake, and more' },
              ].map((f) => (
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-deep/50 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <div class="text-xs font-medium text-text-primary">{f.label}</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">{f.desc}</div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Datacenter Solutions -->
        <a href="/products/datacenter" class="group glow-card-subtle block p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
                <span class="text-3xl">🏗️</span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-amber/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber">Product</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber sm:text-3xl">Datacenter Solutions</h2>
              <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-text-muted">ExaScale Thermal Intelligence</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
                The world's first AI thermal management system built on real exascale
                supercomputer operational data. Our ensemble ML engine combines 5 forecasting
                algorithms to deliver 95% prediction accuracy with 30-60 minute horizons —
                cutting cooling costs by 15% and saving $2-5M annually per facility.
                Products: ThermalVault, HeatHarvest, ThermalTwin, CarbonZero.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-amber">
                Explore ExaScale
                <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              {[
                { label: 'Ensemble ML', desc: 'ARIMA+Kalman, FFT, Holt-Winters, physics validation' },
                { label: 'Digital Twin', desc: 'Real-time thermal state replication + what-if sims' },
                { label: 'Heat Recovery', desc: 'AI-optimized waste heat → energy revenue' },
                { label: 'Carbon Zero', desc: 'Automated ESG compliance + carbon credit trading' },
                { label: '95% Accuracy', desc: '30-60 min forecasts, 4-6x better than competitors' },
                { label: '$2-5M Savings', desc: 'Per large facility annually, 18-24 mo payback' },
              ].map((f) => (
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-deep/50 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <div class="text-xs font-medium text-text-primary">{f.label}</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">{f.desc}</div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
